    "methods_description": "Intracranial electrophysiological recordings were collected during a delayed free recall paradigm involving visual presentation of word lists, arithmetic distractor tasks, and free recall. Recordings were made on multiple systems and standardized to voltage units (V). Both monopolar (referenced, typically mastoid) and bipolar recordings are included with accompanying electrode localization data in MNI and Talairach coordinates.",
